      "partGroupId": "partGroup_y_left_rod_assembly",
      "sequenceIndex": 189,
      "family": "Use",
      "instructionText": "Tighten the two shorter idler bolts with an electric drill to grip the rods firmly. Leave the longer bolt loose \u00e2\u20ac\u201d it will be used to attach the axis to the frame."
    },
