      "title": "Four-point bench QC before labeling",
      "message": "Check all four before calling it done: (1) Belt moves smoothly along full rod travel \u00e2\u20ac\u201d no binding. (2) Rod ends flush with idler bottom \u00e2\u20ac\u201d push them back if sticking out. (3) Idler bolt heads and carriage bolt heads on the same side. (4) Toothed side of belt faces inward toward the motor pulley. Label Y-Left with masking tape and marker. Set aside for frame mounting.",
